Package: tihulu-jarvis
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: TIHULU JARVIS maintainers <maintainers@tihulu.invalid>
Installed-Size: 2048
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-pango-1.0, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, librsvg2-common, libcairo2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Tihulu/Tihulu-Voice-Assistant
Description: Offline-first multilingual desktop assistant
 A local, private assistant with chat and voice, TR/EN/DE conversation
 routing, an explicit local Jan connection and installed model choices.
 It starts no listener, downloads nothing on its own and keeps its data
 under the invoking user's XDG directories.
